{"name": "Dronaldo Drone Football League", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"52\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/37355c6ac7b0e7743a953a46701ba84c.poster.avif?t=1784038257\" width=\"414\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/37355c6ac7b0e7743a953a46701ba84c.webm?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/37355c6ac7b0e7743a953a46701ba84c.mp4?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Drone Football League</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of combat drones and dominate the pitch in <i>Dronaldo</i>, the thrilling televised spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending fast-paced sports action with class-based shooter mechanics, <i>Dronaldo</i> delivers explosive abilities, unpredictable physics, and nonstop competitive chaos in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/8c7af1c6c459725813cb92adf89f2f46.poster.avif?t=1784038257\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/8c7af1c6c459725813cb92adf89f2f46.webm?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/8c7af1c6c459725813cb92adf89f2f46.mp4?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete in High-Octane Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into quick matches or dive into a story-driven campaign packed with charming characters and non-stop action. Rise through the ranks, steal the spotlight, and prove you\u2019ve got what it takes to become the next Drone Football League star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/234238291f083854527b98ce6a77575f.poster.avif?t=1784038257\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/234238291f083854527b98ce6a77575f.webm?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/234238291f083854527b98ce6a77575f.mp4?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Chaos on the Field</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use powerful abilities to attack rival drones, traverse dynamic arenas, and outplay your opponents with strategy, skill, and smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/2d9927b7b6542df0ffc488096c468a82.poster.avif?t=1784038257\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/2d9927b7b6542df0ffc488096c468a82.webm?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/2d9927b7b6542df0ffc488096c468a82.mp4?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Go head-to-head online &amp; in local split-screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your skills online and battle other wannabe drone football stars in quick, explosive matches - or dust off that second remote and challenge your friends to split-screen carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/c2c51ead4bd8ab0a7f7221e84038bbec.poster.avif?t=1784038257\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/c2c51ead4bd8ab0a7f7221e84038bbec.webm?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/c2c51ead4bd8ab0a7f7221e84038bbec.mp4?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Drone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fine-tune your playstyle by distributing mastery points across key stats, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooldown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suppression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regeneration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Autonomy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a drone that fits how you want to play - fast, tanky, tactical, or just pure chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/05eb3dde52ab5e32af50ae9f33e0b1a8.poster.avif?t=1784038257\" width=\"534\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/05eb3dde52ab5e32af50ae9f33e0b1a8.webm?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/05eb3dde52ab5e32af50ae9f33e0b1a8.mp4?t=1784038257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your Squad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not alone on the field. Build and manage your squad to create the perfect team composition. Focus on offense, defence, or craft a completely unique strategy - the decision is in your hands!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Rise through the league ranks in this indie vehicular team sports game blended with a third-person arena shooter. Use your class abilities to manoeuvre, damage, destroy, support, and defend your opponents and allies to win the ball and lead your team to victory!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/04249a9f2e86d3e0f604970d6083b1462a7cd371/header.jpg?t=1784038257", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Sports", "Arena Shooter", "Combat Racing", "Football (Soccer)", "Real Time Tactics", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "The Koala Republic", "publishers": "The Koala Republic", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3491420", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "27 November 2025 - Request Access\n\n4 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/5nC7vrn17ME", "first_seen": 1764198000.0, "review_rank": 1408}